  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS - 9623 - PPG - Promoting sustainable economic benefits through the conservation of critical biodiversity and ecosystem services in the Eastern Coastal Region of Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting sustainable economic benefits through the conservation of critical biodiversity and ecosystem services in the Eastern coastal region of Sri Lanka. As described in the PIF, this project aims to address the current and future development pressures to the biologically rich terrestrial, coastal and marine ecosystems in the Southern and Eastern parts of the country through improved governance, policies and capacities of institutions for promotion of integrated landscape/seascape approaches</narrative>
  </description>
